# Excludes from the docker build context for the website's Dockerfile
# (Railway runs `dockerfilePath: apps/website/Dockerfile` with the repo
# root as the build context).

node_modules
**/node_modules

# Build artefacts
**/dist
**/.vite
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.turbo

# Editor / OS noise
.git
.github
.changeset
.claude
.cursor
.DS_Store

# Workspaces the website doesn't need at build time
benchmarks
# …except its package.json — pnpm install needs it because benchmarks
# is a workspace member in pnpm-workspace.yaml.
!benchmarks/package.json
docs
scripts
assets
blueprint.md

# Keep package-level READMEs out unless explicitly needed by the build
**/CHANGELOG.md
